    "updated_at": "2022-01-13T18:18:07Z",
    "body": "It's possible that the number of prompt lines changes over time, for instance if the starship config changes, so I'd prefer if it was done on each prompt draw. It might also be faster to execute with a loop and `IndexOf` instead of splitting the string.",
