    "body": "Using https://gist.github.com/tommymaynard/c97c5248d76aba08f1c8aa01096aa12b, Can't see much of a difference:\r\n```pwsh\r\n~\r\n❯ Measure-TMCommand { (prompt).Split(\"`n\").Length } -Repetitions 1000 | select -last 1\r\n\r\nDateTime            : 13/01/2022 23:04:42\r\nCommand             :  (prompt).Split(\"`n\").Length\r\nRepetition          : 1000\r\nHours               : 0\r\nMinutes             : 0\r\nSeconds             : 0\r\nMilliseconds        : 26\r\nAverageHours        : 0\r\nAverageMinutes      : 0\r\nAverageSeconds      : 0\r\nAverageMilliseconds : 30.898\r\n\r\n~\r\n❯ Measure-TMCommand { $prompt = prompt; $count = 0; for ($j = $prompt.IndexOf(\"`n\", 0); $j -ne -1; $j = $prompt.IndexOf(\"`n\", $j + 1)) { $count++ }; $count } -Repetitions 1000 | select -last 1\r\n\r\nDateTime            : 13/01/2022 23:10:54\r\nCommand             :  $prompt = prompt; $count = 0; for ($j = $prompt.IndexOf(\"`n\", 0); $j -ne -1; $j =\r\n                      $prompt.IndexOf(\"`n\", $j + 1)) { $count++ }; $count\r\nRepetition          : 1000\r\nHours               : 0\r\nMinutes             : 0\r\nSeconds             : 0\r\nMilliseconds        : 157\r\nAverageHours        : 0\r\nAverageMinutes      : 0\r\nAverageSeconds      : 0\r\nAverageMilliseconds : 32.82\r\n```",
