    "body": "@rashil2000 I guess it's fine to only set it once, given that starship mostly gets away with not setting it at all now. But it would be more complicated, and I'd like to avoid running an extra `starship prompt` on startup just for this. For context, OhMyPosh [sets it on every prompt](https://github.com/JanDeDobbeleer/oh-my-posh/blob/main/src/init/omp.ps1#L94-L97), but they can use `.Count` because they already have a list of lines to work with.\r\n\r\n@segevfiner In this case the simpler `Split` solution would be preferable.",
